AI-enabled recruiting: From nice to necessary
This background and context turned AI-enabled recruiting from nice-to-have to necessary-to-employ. AI-enabled recruiting tools have primarily been employed across four general sets of activities: outreach, screening, assessment, and coordination. In the outreach stage, firms try to identify candidates and get job opportunities in front of them in ways that will prompt them to apply. Applying for a position might involve filling in a digital application or electronically transmitting a résumé.
